      "content": "hey... i need to talk to someone about something really weird that just happened at work. idrk how to explain it but i was getting really frustrated/upset in the breakroom and suddenly all the overhead lights started flickering like crazy and my phone just died right then too. like it's happened a few times now when i'm feeling really intense emotions. do u think it's possible i'm like... projecting some kind of kinetic energy or something when i get worked up? it's starting to freak me out a bit.",
